    "raw_text": "Account & Password FAQ\nDomain: User account management and login support.\nDataset purpose: This document is a sample knowledge-base source for a Multimodal\nRetrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) FAQ system.\nThe visual above is intentionally embedded so the data-extraction module can detect and extract images from the PDF.\nQ1. How do I reset my password?\nOpen the login page and select Forgot Password. Enter your registered email address and follow the reset\nlink sent to your inbox. Create a new password and sign in again.\nQ2. What should I do if I do not receive the reset email?\nCheck the spam or junk folder first. Confirm that the email address is correct. If the message is still missing,\nwait a few minutes and request another reset link.\nQ3. Can I change my password while logged in?\nYes. Open Account Settings, select Security or Change Password, enter the current password, and then\nenter the new password twice.\nQ4. Why is my account temporarily locked?\nAn account may be temporarily locked after repeated unsuccessful login attempts. Wait for the lock period\nto end or use the supported account-recovery procedure.\nSource type: Synthetic sample FAQ document | Suitable for local development and extraction testing.",
